Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- 縮放到選取的元件 (Blend's Zoom to selection; right-click 顯示, palette):
  the largest zoom step at which the whole selection fits the view with a
  margin (400% at most), scrolled so it sits in the middle; nothing selected
  = zoom to fit. Asked with a seq, the probe says what it went by.
- 改名稱: a component hidden (the eye) or locked in the designer keeps that
  under its new name.
- test/vscode_it.ps1: the all-pages sweep on 20260930 flagged main.html and
  background.html as changed during the test -- another session had merged
  laptop web packages and committed them (web repo abaf098 / e099c92) while
  it ran; this test saved nothing. A page that changed during the test now
  counts as someone else's (WARN, with the commit) only when the test saved
  nothing AND the page's content is what its repo holds AND that commit is
  from after the test started; anything else stays a FAIL.

Checked: the 83-page sweep after R38-R42: 195 pass / 0 fail (the two pages
above aside), nothing saved.

Tests: probe (the Save button -> exactly the step it fits, in view), smoke
(the command reaches the probe; a locked spbSave renamed btnSave is locked
as btnSave), real VS Code (spbSave 227x40 in this window's 273x676 column ->
0.9x, the step checked from the probe's own numbers; back to 100%).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
